"""Run a fail-closed context-pack quality benchmark over a frozen saved-recall v3 set.

The benchmark is intentionally separate from ``recall-quality-eval``.  The
saved-recall evaluator remains the owner of Recall@K/MRR and related retrieval
metrics; this command records the production context-pack quality sample that
the Gateway emits for the same frozen holdout.  It never recomputes or
reweights ``contextPackQualityScore``.

The default artifact is the Gateway-owned v3 case-set path.  A run evaluates
every held-out case in that artifact, calls ``POST /memory/context-pack`` once
per case, and then requests the existing saved-recall holdout metrics as a
separate report.  A missing, synthetic, contaminated, partial, or mismatched
artifact/result can never become promotion evidence.
"""

